-       $$ \text{clockwise} = \text{input.get\_value}(x, y, z) > 0 $$ [S1, unofficial].
-     - The `create_quad` function adds two triangles to `index_list` forming the quad, ordered to respect the `clockwise` flag for correct face culling [G].
